### Build Test
✅ **Passed**: Build completed successfully with no errors
- Command: `npm run build`
- Result: Generated production bundle in 6.36s
- Output: dist/assets files with proper hashing

### Type Checking
✅ **Passed**: TypeScript compilation successful (verified through build)

### Linter & Tests
- No linter configured in project (no lint script in package.json)
